  "성능정보": {
   "null_rate": 0.0,
   "unique": 191,
   "top": {
    "1. Cutting-Table 1set 2. Pump 1set 3. Control System 1set 4. Drilling Unit 1Set 5. 연마재 회수 장치 1set (회수 펌프 및 이동식 침전조 1기) 6. 폐수처리시스템 (연속 침전조) 1set 7. 연마재 공급 시스템 1set 8. 냉각 장치 (Chiller) 1set 9. Clean Door System 1set (사용자 안전장치 설치)": 10,
    "ㅇ 구성 및 성능 ㅇCalorimetry 성능 - Temperature range : -180℃ ~ 725℃ - 상온 ~ 725°C : Air Cooling - -90°C ~ 600°C : Mechanical Cooling - Liquid N2 Cooling : 5 minutes - Mechanical Cooling : 7 minutes (67°C/min) - Air Cooling : 30 minutes (15°C/min) - (w/Quench Can) : 7 minutes (67°C/min)": 10,
    "(1) Vickers Hardness Tester: 1) Test Force : 1, 5, 10, 20, 30, 50kgf or more 2) Accuracy of Test Force : 1% or less 3) Microscope Magnification : ① Tester only: 100 (Obj. Lens 10) ② With Heating Furnace Chamber : 100 (Obj. Lens 5) ③ Minimum Reading : 1㎛ or better 4) Loading Control : Automatic (Loading, Duration and Unloading) 5) Test Force Exchange : By Dial Exchange knob. 6) Test Force Duration Time : 5 ~ 30s or more 7) Standard : JIS B 7725, ISO 6507-2, KS B 0811, JIS Z 2252 (2) Heating Furnace Chamber: 1) Heating Temperature : RT - 1200℃ or higher 2) Heating Atmosphere : Inert Gas (Ar Gas) 3) Insert Gas Consumption : 4 Litters/test or less 4) Test Sample Size - Diameter 10mm 0.1mm or more - Thickness 5mm 0.3mm or more - 6 - 7 mm square or bigger - Sample Movement Range 6mm 6mm or bigger (3) Temperature Control (4) Auto reading & Data analysis S/W 1) Standard Accs for Measuring S/W 2) Measuring Program 3) Color CCD camera 4) Lens Adapter (On Machine) 5) Easy measurement using a mouse": 10,
    "1.1. Main Body 1) Tension Part a) Moving system : precision A/C servo motor or better b) Test Area : (W x H) 630 x 1474 mm or more c) Loading capacity : 250 kN or higher d) Load measuring accuracy : within 0.5% of indicated value e) Strain measurement accuracy : within 0.05% of indicated value f) Test speed range : Min 0.0001 mm/min or slower Max 600 mm/min or faster g) Test return speed range : 1000 mm/min or slower h) Speed accuracy : within 0.05% of set speed i) Repeat positioning accuracy on crosshead : within 2 ㎛ j) Drive system travel resolution : within 0.19227 nm k) Measured value sampling rate : 400 kHz, 24 bit or better l) Measured value transmission rate to PC : 1 kHz or more m) Tensile testing speed should be controlled by both strain control and stress controlmode according to ISO 6892-1 and ASTM, EN, JIS, KS, etc. n) Remote controller for manual test : data tracking of display load and position, cross head mov ing, speed control, Start, Initial position, Stop button, extensometer open/close button, Grip open/ close button (Programmable)": 10,
    "공란": 10,
    "1. Measuring ranges at 0.5~1.0g sample weight 　1-1. Induction furnace Low carbon : up to 0.1% C at 500mg sample resp. up to 0.5mg C High carbon : up to 5% C at 500mg sample resp. up to 25mg C (indicating range up to 100% C) Low sulfur : up to 0.3% S at 500mg sample resp. up to 1.5mg S High sulfur : up to 30% S at 150mg sample resp. up to 45mg S (indicating range up to 100% S) 1-2. Resistance furnace Low carbon : up to 1.25mg C resp. Up to 0.25% C at 500mg sample High carbon : up to 100mg C resp. Up to 20% C at 500mg sample (indicating range up to 100% C) Low sulfur : up to 2% S at 500mg sample resp. up to 10mg S High sulfur : up to 20% S at 500mg sample resp. up to 100mg S (indicating range up to 100% S) 　 2. Sensitivity 　2-1. Induction furnace Carbon : 0.1ppm c at 500mg sample resp. 0.05㎍ C Sulfur : 0.1ppm s at 500mg sample resp. 0.05㎍ S 2-2. Resistance furnace Carbon : 5㎍ C resp. 10 ppm C at 500mg sample Sulfur : 1㎍ S resp. 2 ppm S at 500mg sample 　 3. Accuracy 　3-1. Indu": 6,
    "○ Power supply: 110V/50Hz or 230V/60Hz (must be defined at the order) ○ Air pressure: Nozzle T1 ISO B thread male plug 1/4BSP ○ Injection pot (pressurized tank) ○ User manual / Technical document of the bench permeability ○ in-plane, Kx and Ky permeability test ○ 300*300mm square sample with central hole Ф16mm ○ 1~30mm thick preform ○ through-thickness, Kz permeability test ○ Ф250mm dimension disc sample ○ 1~15mm thick preform ○ fiber volume contents Between 30% and 60% (depending of the reinforcement) ○ Central injection (no race tracking effects) with constant pressure in Kx, Ky measurement ○ Injection at room temperature ○ Injection pressure: 5 bars max ○ Working with any kind of fibers(Carbon, glass, natural fiber, etc.) ○ Permeability values measured with RTM process = Rigid Mold": 6,
    "1. 원료용융장치 : 용융 Tank. 용융 Tank 승강장치. 진공장치시스템, 가스 급/배기시스템, 온도제어시스템으로 구성되며, 5*10-2 Torr까지의 진공분위기 형성이 가능하며 진공상태에서 승온하여 고체 원료를 녹인다음 잘 녹인 것이 잘 섞히도록 Agitating하여 완전히 녹힌 것이 확인되면 분위기가스(N2)로 치환하여 불활성분위기 형성 후 방사기 원료 공급 Pot로 이송하여 사용한다. 2. 방사기장치: 원료공급Pot.방사기.Winder, 온도제어시스템, 구동제어시스템으로 구성되며, 공급되어진 원료가 Gear Pump로 통해 일정량으로 Nozzle을 통해 방사가되며 방사된 Yarn은 일정량으로 Bobbin에 감기도록 Wonder 구동부 속도를 제어하며 사용한다.": 6,
    "- 일체형 Body 와 분리가 가능한 19” Analysis rack - Heat Flux meter (for ISO 5660) 사용시 수도배관공사가 필요 없는 Portable Water Cooling System - 착화시간측정을 용이하게 해주는 자동 Spark Igniter - 시편에 복사열을 전달하기 위해 자동으로 열리는 Auto Split Shutter - Laser Calibration을 진행 가능하게 하는 Filter Block - 시험 중 사용자를 보호하기 위한 Chamber Type의 Glass Protection Door - O2 농도를 0.001%까지 정확하게 측정하는 Gas Analyser - 모든 Gas flow에 MFC (Mass Flow Controller)를 적용하여 정확한 자동 유량 제어 기능 - Heat Flux meter (for ISO 5660) 사용시 수도배관공사가 필요 없는 Portable Water Cooling System - 정밀한 질량감소율을 측정하기 위해 보다 정확성이 향상된 Load Cell - Burner Calibraion시 온도 조건에 따라 Methane Gas의 자동유량 제어(Mass Flow Controller) 시스템 구성": 6,
    "Ø270*300L 크기의 롤에 감겨 있는 PSiC섬유(100m이상)를 연속으로 분위기 열처리하며 중간에 끊기지 않게 롤의 회전수를 조절한다. 온도제어는 프로그램방식 온도제어기를 통한 PID 연속제어(3Zone)이고 유효공간 : Ø50 * 2000 (W*H, mm)수직형 측면 개폐 가능하고 섬유투입구와 탈출구 곁에 롤구동 장치가 부착되어 PCS섬유을 풀어주어 로에 투입하고 로에 배출된 SiOC섬유를 감을 수 있다.": 6
